## Team Coordination Rules

1. All agents read `active-project.md` before starting any session.
2. Work only on the active project unless the PM explicitly changes it.
3. Handoffs require: (a) deliverable artifact, (b) updated status.md, (c) explicit kickoff message.
4. Blocked milestones are marked BLOCKED and require human input before resuming.
5. No agent may modify another agent's primary output files without explicit coordination.
6. In overnight mode: implement milestones, run tests, fix bugs only. No architecture changes.

